===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|kerze}}, from {{inh|de|goh|kerza}}, {{m|goh|charza}}, from either {{der|de|la|cērāta||covered with wax}} or {{cog|la|charta}} (“sheet of papyrus”, in this case referring to layers of birch bark from which candles were made). The latter explanation is typically preferred, though the former is semantically more suggestive. Compare {{cog|nl|kaars}}, {{cog|lb|Käerz}}.

